  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il est malade, sa goutte au nez\ndégèle et ses capacités de type Glace\ndeviennent moins efficaces.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it is not feeling well, its mucus\ngets watery and the power of its\nIce-type moves decreases.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a toujours la goutte au nez. Il\nl’aspire pour déclencher ses capacités.\nLa morve en est la matière première.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its nose is always running. It sniffs the\nsnot back up because the mucus\nprovides the raw material for its moves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Their snot is a barometer of health.\nWhen healthy, their snot is sticky and\nthe power of their ice moves increases.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Their snot is a barometer of health.\nWhen healthy, their snot is sticky and\nthe power of their ice moves increases.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつも　はなみずを　たらしている。\nはなみずを　すすって　わざを　だす。\nはなみずが　わざの　もと　なのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "언제나 콧물을 달고 다닌다.\n콧물을 훌쩍거려 기술을 사용한다.\n콧물이 기술의 재료인 셈이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a toujours la goutte au nez. Il l’aspire pour\ndéclencher ses capacités. La morve en est la matière\npremière.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Schleim, der stets aus seiner Nase hängt,\ntreibt seine Attacken an. Zieht es ihn hoch,\nsteht ein Angriff bevor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre está con mucosidades colgando. Las aspira\npara hacer un movimiento, ya que son su materia prima\npara esto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha sempre il naso gocciolante e se ne serve per\nlanciare le sue mosse. Il muco è l’origine della sua\nforza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its nose is always running. It sniffs the snot back up\nbecause the mucus provides the raw material for\nits moves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつも　鼻水を　垂らしている。\n鼻水を　すすって　技を　出す。\n鼻水が　技の　素　なのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre está con mucosidades colgando. Las aspira\npara hacer un movimiento, ya que son su materia prima\npara esto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はなみずは　けんこうの　バロメータ。\nちょうしが　いいと　ねばりづよくなり\nこおりの　わざの　いりょくも　ます。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "콧물은 건강의 척도다.\n상태가 좋으면 점성이 높아지고\n얼음 기술의 위력도 증가한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa roupie indique sa santé. S’il est en forme,\nelle sera épaisse et la puissance de ses attaques\nglacées augmentera.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fühlt es sich wohl, wird der Schleim, der aus seiner\nNase trieft, klebrig und die Stärke seiner Eis-Attacken\nnimmt zu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus mocos son su barómetro de salud. Si es buena,\nserán densos, y la fuerza de sus movimientos de tipo\nHielo aumentará.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La goccia del naso è il barometro della sua salute. Se\nsta bene è bella viscosa e potenzia le sue mosse\ndi tipo Ghiaccio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy,\ntheir snot is sticky and the power of their ice\nmoves increases.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
